{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午10時50分，警方接報上水清曉路一個地盤發生工業意外。一名男子遭鐵枝插傷下顎，繼而墮地。人員到場將一段鐵枝剪短，插住下顎的部份未能即場拔去，遂連人帶鐵枝將傷者送往沙田威爾斯醫院處理，案件列工業意外跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192826761658765312174325.jpeg/hu0dLeUBoCxvsZolByBoRdTmUigVZUIzy0mh58tJoec\"/><figcaption>傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192826763793797120916320.jpeg/kUHRINL0chcm5Xly2ljNcSFxl3Ze7uXvQxuWzEMblsw\"/><figcaption>傷者送院時下顎還插有鐵枝。</figcaption></figure><p>消息稱，傷者32歲，屬高級工程師，事發時他與房署人員巡地盤時跣倒；現階段醫護人員正為他進行移除鐵枝的手術，家人亦已趕抵醫院。</p><figure><img alt=\"鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811681449775104192380.jpeg/JdVPwcKwzYHt3TXU73DiXgc-orMX8I02t7sDRbe7A0U\"/><figcaption>鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811699812962304568420.jpeg/l62W5KJv8xtcaRBAfMRl1kI1K2Qa9h7Y9RQGmPUUBpg\"/><figcaption>鐵枝上有敷料。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場是房屋署的地盤，正進行地基工程，插有大量鋼筋。事故原因有待調查，勞工處及警方正在跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811697153642496603589.jpeg/PowXiHfbhksRTtxyOpTjuQXVRnROy9gUHYJCkx2CQpM\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811691642064896537294.jpeg/YFnMuX9lOvAYMsQE8hKGW8tQO1SKcOSTAp-_UwKfv1M\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192811688013860864219573.jpeg/TFJ5MdOwGXdC6_evl9MI-EK5yBDdjxjdzJxPfsycT34\"/><figcaption>現場是房署的地盤。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821841547235328354926.jpeg/77s1e4T3ubBwlYrwuXr0a0aQ2Z18nUb2JP10riT9dK4\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821844554682368236791.jpeg/kTSI0QObRaZdGCmDeUqONfYVPv9ZM3lfX7PKxF-zysQ\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821847495020544654128.jpeg/XW3FThnIsbngNrl1GoNOHg4HMXHXQ9_l9zgXxPc4F8Q\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821850628296704863514.jpeg/kN5dY9Et1dbMziFTxF9csh9DVrLEdoui6SMzAOkjMwA\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192821854629793792812369.jpeg/sZi2KzgpH5HK0NdnXjWSAMR52OzuVrk7VIHFBFSBxQQ\"/><figcaption>勞工處等人員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:39.428474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:43:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:01:21.250786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:35.002112+00:00","content_hash":"593b4db4baa017ab8c4e756125b4a8606443b01295326df9323af2e01d836aa1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}